OL,3,GNEWSAHealthcare workers walk out on
OL,4,A24-hour strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealthcare workers have gone on strike
OL,7,Fin protest at workloads and staffing
OL,8,Fissues.
OL,10,FStaff from the HCRG Care Group in Bath,
OL,11,FChippenham and Swindon who are members
OL,12,Fof Unison walked out at 08:00 BST on
OL,13,FWednesday until 08:00 on Thursday.
OL,14,FPatients have been told to go to
OL,15,Fappointments.
OL,17,FJoanne Hateley, clinical advisor and
OL,18,Fex-nurse, was on a picket line. "I go
OL,19,Fhome and I just cry some nights," she
OL,20,Fsaid, because "I don't feel as though
OL,21,FI'm making a difference any more".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
