OL,3,GNEWSAHealthcare workers walk out on
OL,4,A24-hour strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the walkout, Unison ran a
OL,7,Fballot with 85% of members voting for
OL,8,Fstrike action. An HCRG Care Group
OL,9,Fspokesperson said "robust contingency
OL,10,Fplans" were in place and they
OL,11,Frecognised "the challenges colleagues
OL,12,Fhave experienced".
